# Coverage Reports Directory

This directory stores generated coverage reports from the coverage validation tests.

Files generated here include:
- coverage_report.json: Combined entity and action coverage report
- entity_coverage.json: Detailed entity coverage report
- entity_coverage.txt: Console-formatted entity coverage report
- actions/: Per-entity action coverage reports

To generate reports, run:
```python
from tests.compat.coverage_validator import generate_coverage_reports

async with CiviClient() as client:
    await generate_coverage_reports(
        client,
        output_dir="tests/compat/coverage_reports",
    )
```

Note: Generated files are not committed to version control.
